{"zh":[{"start":4.77,"end":10.48,"text":"2018 年，加州已经连续第六年干旱，"},{"start":10.48,"end":16.63,"text":"为「营地大火」埋下伏笔，那是加州历史上破坏最严重的火灾。"},{"start":19.05,"end":22.47,"text":"大火烧过的面积比芝加哥市还大，"},{"start":22.47,"end":26.65,"text":"毁掉了一万四千栋建筑。"},{"start":26.65,"end":30.12,"text":"我们通常把气候变化和更多的洪水联系在一起，"},{"start":30.12,"end":32.0,"text":"更强的飓风，"},{"start":32.0,"end":34.44,"text":"还有海平面上升。"},{"start":34.44,"end":36.88,"text":"但世界上有些地区预计会"},{"start":36.88,"end":40.65,"text":"随着气候变暖变得更干更热。"},{"start":40.65,"end":42.17,"text":"火需要两样东西："},{"start":42.17,"end":47.14,"text":"足够的燃料，而且燃料要干到能着火。"},{"start":47.14,"end":51.5,"text":"干旱越多，植物变干，火大概也越多。"},{"start":51.5,"end":54.67,"text":"可是如果干旱持续很长时间，"},{"start":54.67,"end":56.08,"text":"比如特大干旱，"},{"start":56.08,"end":58.65,"text":"反而可能意味着火更少。"},{"start":58.65,"end":64.02,"text":"因为没有植物，火可能就没有燃料可烧了。"},{"start":64.02,"end":66.77,"text":"但这其实不是新问题。"},{"start":66.77,"end":72.0,"text":"两位 NASA 科学家最近的一项研究，首次提供证据"},{"start":72.0,"end":76.63,"text":"证明人类排放的温室气体影响了干旱模式，"},{"start":76.63,"end":79.95,"text":"早在 20 世纪初就开始了。"},{"start":79.95,"end":82.17,"text":"NASA 努力了解我们的过去，"},{"start":82.17,"end":85.34,"text":"很大程度上是因为需要预测我们的未来"},{"start":85.34,"end":88.18,"text":"——好比火灾先行一步。"},{"start":88.18,"end":91.87,"text":"为此，研究人员建立模型，不仅帮助"},{"start":91.87,"end":95.82,"text":"消防员更好地预测火会往哪里、怎样蔓延，"},{"start":95.82,"end":100.98,"text":"还帮助森林管理者判断计划烧除什么时候安全。"},{"start":100.98,"end":106.46,"text":"NASA 科学家时刻监测淡水和火情，"},{"start":106.46,"end":109.77,"text":"从太空、空中和地面，"},{"start":109.77,"end":114.45,"text":"在地球气候不断变化时收集短期和长期数据。"},{"start":114.45,"end":119.18,"text":"展望未来，模型是我们手里最好的工具之一，"},{"start":119.18,"end":124.14,"text":"用来应对全世界变化中的干旱季和火灾季。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":4.77,"end":10.48,"text":"In 2018, California was already in its sixth consecutive year of drought","words":[["In","在"],["2018,","2018年"],["California","加州"],["was","曾"],["already","已经"],["in","在"],["its","它的"],["sixth","第六"],["consecutive","连续的"],["year","年"],["of","的"],["drought","干旱"]]},{"start":10.48,"end":16.63,"text":"setting the stage for the Camp Fire, the most destructive fire in California's history.","words":[["setting","布置"],["the","这"],["stage","舞台"],["for","为"],["the","这"],["Camp","营地"],["Fire,","大火"],["the","这"],["most","最"],["destructive","具破坏性的"],["fire","火灾"],["in","在"],["California's","加州的"],["history.","历史"]]},{"start":19.05,"end":22.47,"text":"The fire burned an area larger than the city of Chicago","words":[["The","这"],["fire","火"],["burned","烧了"],["an","一个"],["area","面积"],["larger","更大"],["than","比"],["the","这"],["city","城市"],["of","的"],["Chicago","芝加哥"]]},{"start":22.47,"end":26.65,"text":"and destroyed 14,000 buildings.","words":[["and","并"],["destroyed","摧毁了"],["14,000","14000"],["buildings.","建筑"]]},{"start":26.65,"end":30.12,"text":"We usually think of climate change in the context of more flooding","words":[["We","我们"],["usually","通常"],["think","想到"],["of",""],["climate","气候"],["change","变化"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["context","背景"],["of","的"],["more","更多"],["flooding","洪水"]]},{"start":30.12,"end":32.0,"text":"more intense hurricanes,","words":[["more","更"],["intense","强的"],["hurricanes,","飓风"]]},{"start":32.0,"end":34.44,"text":"and rising sea levels.","words":[["and","和"],["rising","上升的"],["sea","海"],["levels.","平面"]]},{"start":34.44,"end":36.88,"text":"But some areas of the world are forecasted to","words":[["But","但"],["some","一些"],["areas","地区"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["world","世界"],["are","被"],["forecasted","预测"],["to","会"]]},{"start":36.88,"end":40.65,"text":"get drier and hotter as the climate warms up.","words":[["get","变得"],["drier","更干"],["and","和"],["hotter","更热"],["as","随着"],["the","这"],["climate","气候"],["warms","变暖"],["up.",""]]},{"start":40.65,"end":42.17,"text":"Fire needs two things:","words":[["Fire","火"],["needs","需要"],["two","两样"],["things:","东西"]]},{"start":42.17,"end":47.14,"text":"enough fuel and fuel that's dry enough to catch fire.","words":[["enough","足够的"],["fuel","燃料"],["and","和"],["fuel","燃料"],["that's","那是"],["dry","干"],["enough","足以"],["to","去"],["catch","着"],["fire.","火"]]},{"start":47.14,"end":51.5,"text":"More droughts probably mean more fire as vegetation dries out.","words":[["More","更多"],["droughts","干旱"],["probably","大概"],["mean","意味着"],["more","更多"],["fire","火"],["as","随着"],["vegetation","植被"],["dries","变干"],["out.",""]]},{"start":51.5,"end":54.67,"text":"However, if those droughts continue for a long period,","words":[["However,","然而"],["if","如果"],["those","那些"],["droughts","干旱"],["continue","持续"],["for","达"],["a","一个"],["long","长"],["period,","时期"]]},{"start":54.67,"end":56.08,"text":"like a megadrought,","words":[["like","像"],["a","一场"],["megadrought,","特大干旱"]]},{"start":56.08,"end":58.65,"text":"it can actually mean less fire.","words":[["it","它"],["can","能"],["actually","实际上"],["mean","意味着"],["less","更少"],["fire.","火"]]},{"start":58.65,"end":64.02,"text":"Because without plants, fires may run out of fuel to burn.","words":[["Because","因为"],["without","没有"],["plants,","植物"],["fires","火"],["may","可能"],["run","用"],["out","完"],["of","的"],["fuel","燃料"],["to","去"],["burn.","烧"]]},{"start":64.02,"end":66.77,"text":"But this actually isn't a new problem.","words":[["But","但"],["this","这"],["actually","其实"],["isn't","不是"],["a","一个"],["new","新"],["problem.","问题"]]},{"start":66.77,"end":72.0,"text":"A recent study conducted by two NASA scientists was the first to provide evidence","words":[["A","一项"],["recent","最近的"],["study","研究"],["conducted","进行"],["by","由"],["two","两位"],["NASA","NASA"],["scientists","科学家"],["was","曾是"],["the","这"],["first","首个"],["to","去"],["provide","提供"],["evidence","证据"]]},{"start":72.0,"end":76.63,"text":"that human-generated greenhouse gas emissions were influencing drought patterns","words":[["that","那"],["human-generated","人类产生的"],["greenhouse","温室"],["gas","气体"],["emissions","排放"],["were","曾"],["influencing","影响"],["drought","干旱"],["patterns","模式"]]},{"start":76.63,"end":79.95,"text":"as long ago as the early 1900s.","words":[["as","早"],["long","至"],["ago","早在"],["as",""],["the","这"],["early","初"],["1900s.","1900年代"]]},{"start":79.95,"end":82.17,"text":"NASA's push to understand our past","words":[["NASA's","NASA的"],["push","推动"],["to","去"],["understand","了解"],["our","我们的"],["past","过去"]]},{"start":82.17,"end":85.34,"text":"is in large part driven by the need to predict our future","words":[["is","是"],["in","在"],["large","很大"],["part","部分"],["driven","推动"],["by","被"],["the","这"],["need","需要"],["to","去"],["predict","预测"],["our","我们的"],["future","未来"]]},{"start":85.34,"end":88.18,"text":"-- to stay one step ahead of fires.","words":[["--","—"],["to","去"],["stay","保持"],["one","一"],["step","步"],["ahead","领先"],["of","于"],["fires.","火灾"]]},{"start":88.18,"end":91.87,"text":"To do this, researchers create models that not only help","words":[["To","为了"],["do","做"],["this,","这"],["researchers","研究人员"],["create","建立"],["models","模型"],["that","那"],["not","不"],["only","仅"],["help","帮助"]]},{"start":91.87,"end":95.82,"text":"firefighters better predict where and how a fire might spread,","words":[["firefighters","消防员"],["better","更好"],["predict","预测"],["where","哪里"],["and","和"],["how","怎样"],["a","一场"],["fire","火"],["might","可能"],["spread,","蔓延"]]},{"start":95.82,"end":100.98,"text":"but also help forest managers know when a planned burn is safe.","words":[["but","而"],["also","也"],["help","帮助"],["forest","森林"],["managers","管理者"],["know","知道"],["when","何时"],["a","一次"],["planned","计划的"],["burn","烧除"],["is","是"],["safe.","安全"]]},{"start":100.98,"end":106.46,"text":"NASA scientists monitor both freshwater and fires constantly,","words":[["NASA","NASA"],["scientists","科学家"],["monitor","监测"],["both","既"],["freshwater","淡水"],["and","和"],["fires","火灾"],["constantly,","不断"]]},{"start":106.46,"end":109.77,"text":"from space, the air and the ground,","words":[["from","从"],["space,","太空"],["the","这"],["air","空中"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["ground,","地面"]]},{"start":109.77,"end":114.45,"text":"collecting short- and long-term data as Earth's climate continues to change.","words":[["collecting","收集"],["short-","短"],["and","和"],["long-term","长期"],["data","数据"],["as","随着"],["Earth's","地球的"],["climate","气候"],["continues","继续"],["to","去"],["change.","变化"]]},{"start":114.45,"end":119.18,"text":"Looking to the future, models are one of the best tools we","words":[["Looking","展望"],["to","到"],["the","这"],["future,","未来"],["models","模型"],["are","是"],["one","一个"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["best","最好"],["tools","工具"],["we","我们"]]},{"start":119.18,"end":124.14,"text":"have to prepare for changing drought and fire seasons around the world.","words":[["have","有"],["to","去"],["prepare","准备"],["for","为"],["changing","变化的"],["drought","干旱"],["and","和"],["fire","火灾"],["seasons","季节"],["around","遍及"],["the","这"],["world.","世界"]]}]}